<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16770" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσυμ-πᾰθής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without fellow-feeling</i>
			or <i>sympathy,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑαυτῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Cor.</u>
					21
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.976c
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Herc.</u>
				1251.20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				2.9.16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>Inst.</u>
				28
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τὸν λόγον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>Epict.</u>
					2.9.21
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-θῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					13.111
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Sent.</u>
				32
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> Medic.,
				<i>unaffected</i> by an operation, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				2.60
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> Astrol.,
			epith. of certain <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῴδια,</span>
			<i>Cat. Cod.Astr.</i><i><span class="en">
				1.135.13
			</span></i>. Adv.
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-θῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Vett.Val.
					146.24
				</span></i>
			.</div>
